translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_047dff7d:

    # "Myu fumbled on her words, struggling to get out what she wanted to say."
    "뮤는 말을 더듬으며, 하고 싶은 말을 꺼내려 애쓰고 있었다."

