    # "Myu leapt forward to hug me."
    "뮤가 앞으로 뛰어들어 나를 껴안았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:263
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_6dca0e04:

    # MC "Whoa, easy now!"
    MC "워, 천천히!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:264
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_587718cb:

    # MYU "{i}*Sniff*{/i} Myu is ready to go home now."
    MYU "{i}*훌쩍*{/i} 뮤는 이제 집에 갈 준비가 됐어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:265
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_75df1b81:

    # MC "Come then, Myu, let's get you home."
    MC "가자, 뮤, 집에 데려다줄게."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:267
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_397c7208:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I take it all is resolved?"
    KYLISA @ talk "다 해결된 건가 보죠?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:272
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_d07dee5f:

    # MC @ smile "I think so."
    MC @ smile "그런 것 같아요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:273
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_1918d395:

    # KYLISA @ smile "Good."
    KYLISA @ smile "좋아요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:274
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_1ae85692:

    # MC @ talk "Thank you for helping her."
    MC @ talk "그녀를 도와주셔서 감사합니다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:275
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_5c7b44a3:

    # MC @ talk "I know many wouldn't."
    MC @ talk "많은 사람들이 그러지 않을 거란 걸 알아요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:276
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_15eff0cd:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I am sure one day in the future, you may return this act of kindness."
    KYLISA @ talk "언젠가 미래에, 이 친절을 갚을 기회가 올 거라고 확신해요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:277
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_1fd3c380:

    # KYLISA @ talk "...Tell me something though."
    KYLISA @ talk "...하지만 하나 물어볼게요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:278
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_d669e126:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Why are {i}you{/i} helping this slimelark?"
    KYLISA @ talk "왜 {i}당신이{/i} 이 슬라임라크를 돕고 있는 거죠?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:281
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_6824b63e:

    # KYLISA @ talk "...Very well, as good an answer as any I suppose."
    KYLISA @ talk "...뭐, 그래도 나름 괜찮은 대답이네요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:283
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_54991cbc:

    # KYLISA @ talk "...I see."
    KYLISA @ talk "...그렇군요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:284
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_f9a7a2d5:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Well I hope you and your companion chose wisely in this war and the wars to come."
    KYLISA @ talk "뭐, 당신과 당신의 동료가 이 전쟁과 앞으로 닥칠 전쟁들에서 현명한 선택을 하길 바랄게요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:286
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_f0530664:

    # "...The phrase jumped out of me in a tone so... {i}alien{/i}."
    "...그 말이 내 입에서 너무나... {i}낯선{/i} 어조로 튀어나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:287
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_277775a1:

    # KYLISA @ blush "I... Right, well, as long as {i}she's{/i} happy with that as well I suppose."
    KYLISA @ blush "저... 네, 뭐, {i}그녀도{/i} 그걸로 행복하다면야 뭐."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:288
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_d87ee605:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Perhaps you might want to consider leaving Novaras if that's your long term-plan with her."
    KYLISA @ talk "그게 그녀와의 장기적인 계획이라면, 노바라스를 떠나는 것도 고려해보는 게 좋을지도 몰라요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:289
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_3f3c80c2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The inquisition have punished many... With child or not."
    KYLISA @ talk "종교재판소는 많은 이들을 처벌해왔으니까요... 아이가 있든 없든."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:290
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_843d3cc8:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Anyway, you two should leave now, before someone else comes inquiring."
    KYLISA @ talk "어쨌든, 이제 가보는 게 좋겠어요, 다른 누군가가 찾아오기 전에."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:291
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_6fd3619a:

    # MC @ talk "Thank you, Kylisa."
    MC @ talk "감사합니다, 킬리사."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:293
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_e2cf7747:

    # "After that, the two of us slipped away back home safely."
    "그 후, 우리 둘은 무사히 집으로 돌아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:301
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_a00b8bf6:

    # MYU @ talk "Myu tired, can... can we talk more soon?"
    MYU @ talk "뮤 피곤해, 나... 나중에 더 얘기할 수 있어?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:302
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_b7078ada:

    # MC @ talk "Of course, Myu."
    MC @ talk "물론이지, 뮤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:306
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_7d6bdbfd:

    # "Before she dissolved, Myu turned to face me once more."
    "녹아내리기 전에, 뮤는 다시 한 번 나를 향해 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:307
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_e0576a98:

    # MYU @ talk "Do... [player_name!t] not want to be Myu husband?"
    MYU @ talk "...[player_name!t]은 뮤의 남편이 되기 싫어?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:308
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_edb6a0a6:

    # MC @ surprised "What?"
    MC @ surprised "뭐?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:309
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_6d33c1a7:

    # MYU @ sad "Myu... Understand now, things not as she thought."
    MYU @ sad "뮤... 이제 이해해, 뮤가 생각했던 것과 다르다는 걸."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:310
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_fa435c59:

    # MYU @ sad "Even though Myu wants [player_name!t], not fair to force someone to love who doesn't love back."
    MYU @ sad "뮤는 [player_name!t]을 원하지만, 사랑하지 않는 사람을 억지로 사랑하게 하는 건 옳지 않아."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:311
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_8bcea43e:

    # MYU @ sad "So, what does [player_name!t] want?"
    MYU @ sad "그래서, [player_name!t]은 뭘 원해?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:317
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_9fdc3e39:

    # MYU @ sad "Myu... Myu understand."
    MYU @ sad "뮤... 뮤 이해해."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:318
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_31ceb390:

    # MYU @ sad "Myu is sorry for trying to force what cannot be."
    MYU @ sad "될 수 없는 걸 억지로 하려 해서 미안해."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:319
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_c2a891a5:

    # MC @ talk "I will still keep you safe and look after you Myu, I promise."
    MC @ talk "계속 널 지키고 돌볼게 뮤, 약속할게."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:320
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_a1015a7d:

    # MC @ talk "I just can't be what you {i}want{/i} me to be."
    MC @ talk "그냥 네가 {i}원하는{/i} 사람이 될 수는 없을 뿐이야."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:321
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_2a791db4:

    # MYU @ sad "...Very well, Myu will help when she can."
    MYU @ sad "...알겠어, 뮤는 할 수 있을 때 도울게."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:322
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_59807ae7:

    # MYU @ smile "And maybe, along the way, Myu will find someone who {i}does{/i} want her that way."
    MYU @ smile "그리고 어쩌면, 그러다 보면, 뮤를 그런 식으로 {i}진짜{/i} 원해주는 사람을 만날 수도 있겠지."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:323
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_e2d535af:

    # MC @ talk "Maybe Myu, maybe."
    MC @ talk "그럴지도 몰라, 뮤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:324
translate kr qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_menu_4c680e03:

    # MC "(I hope I have made the right choice with this.)"
    MC "(이 선택이 옳았길 바란다.)"

